        "calls": 1,
        "text": "When your cloud coding session runs out of space or memory, the assistant now explains exactly where your saved files went and how to reach them. Instead of just saying your files are safe, it tells you to open the same chat in the desktop app and select the local option to continue working. This change helps web users avoid the mistake of starting a new, empty cloud chat by clearly pointing them to the desktop version to recover their work. You will notice this new guidance appear in the message that pops up when your cloud environment hits a limit.",
